          Public input will help inform the selection process. Final selections may also consider
          committee review, eligibility, availability, and overall fit with the mission of the
          All-American Icon Awards.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============================================================ -->
    <!-- 5. FEATURED 2026 ALL-AMERICAN ICONS — Bob Anderson + Tony O.   -->
    <!-- "Selected 2026 Honoree" badge on each card.                    -->
    <!-- ============================================================ -->
    <section class="py-14 sm:py-16 bg-navy-dark border-y border-gold/25">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
        <div class="text-center mb-10">
          <p class="text-gold font-bold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-xs sm:text-sm mb-3">Featured 2026 Honorees</p>
